  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]The lunatic\nis on the grass\n[G7]\n[D]The lunatic\nis on the grass\n[G7]\n[D]Remembering\ngames and\n[E/D]daisy chains and laughs\n[A7]Got to keep the\nloonies on the path\n[D]\n[Dsus2]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]The lunatic\nis in the hall\n[G7]\n[D]The lunatics\nare in my\n[G7]hall\n[D]The paper\nholds their folded\n[E/D]faces to the floor\nAnd\n[A7]every day the\npaper boy brings\n[D]more\n[Dsus2]\n[D7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]And if the dam\nbreas open\n[A]many years too soon\nAnd\n[C]if there is no\nroom upon the hill\n[G]\n[G]And if your\nhead explodes with dark\n[A]forbodings too\nI'll\n[C]see you on the dark\nside of the moon\n[G]\n[Bm]\n[Em]\n[A]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D]The lunatic\nis in my head\n[G7]\n[D]The lunatic\nis in my head\n[G7]\n[D]You raise the blade,\n[E/D]you make the change\n[A7]You rearrange\nme 'till I'm sane\n[D]\n[Dsus2]\n[D]You lock the door\nAnd\n[E/D]throw away the key\nThere's\n[A7]someone in my\nhead but it's not\n[D]me.\n[Dsus2]\n[D7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]And if the cloud\nbursts,\n[A]thunder in your ear\n[C]You shout and no\none seems to hear\n[G]\n[G]And if the band\nyou're in starts\n[A]playin' diff'rent tunes\nI'll\n[C]see you on the dark\nside of the moon\n[G]\n[Bm]\n[Em]\n[A]\n\n[Outro]\n[D]\n[G7]\n[D]\n[G7]\n[D]\n[E/D]\n[A7]\n[D]\n[Dsus2]\n[D]\n[E/D]\n[A7]\n[D]\n[Dsus2]",
